OL,11,G0710 Sports Stories: Damien Delaney
OL,12,     FAfter breaking into the Premier
OL,13,     FLeague as a 19-year-old, it took
OL,14,     FDamien Delaney 11 years to make it
OL,15,     Fback to the top. The former
OL,16,     FCrystal Palace defender opens up
OL,17,     Fon his journey.
